course: dictionary
lesson: 6158
title: Short words that stand for longer ones
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: An abbreviation is a short way of writing a longer word. Min is short for minute, and you will see it on clocks, timetables and bus signs. «Next bus 4 min» means the bus comes in 4 minutes.
explain: Min can also be short for minimum, which means the smallest amount allowed. In «min 3 players», the 3 is the least number of players you need. Look at the words around min to decide which meaning fits: a number with time means minutes, and a number with players or people means minimum.
explain: Live bus signs are guesses that change with traffic. «4 min» that becomes «2 min» after 4 minutes means a 6-minute wait in total: 4 minutes passed, then 2 more minutes to wait, so 4 + 2 = 6.
fact: Min is an abbreviation, a short way to write a longer word.
fact: «Min» means minute: there are 60 min in one hour.
fact: «Min» can also mean minimum, the smallest amount allowed, as in «min 2 players».
fact: Check the words around min to see which meaning fits.
fact: Live bus signs guess your wait, and the guess can change with traffic.
exercise: There are 60 min in one hour. What does min mean here? | minimum | million | minus | *minute
exercise: «min 3 players» is written on a game box. What does min mean here? | *the smallest number of players allowed | the biggest number of players | the time the game takes | the name of the game
exercise: A bus sign says «4 min». After 4 minutes it says «2 min». What is the total wait? | 4 minutes | 8 minutes | *6 minutes | 2 minutes
test: Mum says the pasta needs «10 min» to cook. How long is that? | *10 minutes | 10 minimum | 10 hours | 10 metres
test: What is min short for in «min 4 players»? | *minimum | minus | million | minute
exam: A bus sign says «6 min», and after 6 minutes it says «3 min». How long is the total wait? | 6 minutes | 3 minutes | 12 minutes | *9 minutes
